{%- comment -%} Find your Midsummer: five questions to a system, exactly as the preview asks them. The label is the page heading (tag: 'h1') only on the quiz page; in the overlay it is a plain line, so no page has two h1s. Used by the quiz page and, where the store has no quiz page, by the quiz overlay. {%- endcomment -%}
